        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Short duration, documented as 3/7. Haemodynamically stable, observations within normal limits, afebrile in clinic, mild pharyngitis and clear chest. No focal bacterial source or systemic red flags at present."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Condition/condition-2",
